					"text" : "this is the max patch\n\n\nat the top, triggers the entire patch to run. \n\nThe trigger allows for Max and Python to communicate \n\nWhich later gets filters into a list of integers with a one to many connection in unpack\n\nThe 4 intergers are the four fingers on a hand.\n\nwhich use 3 vst's set to different presets to create sound.\n\n\nOne Moment and we will see it in action\n\nThere it is VST Fingers\nWhere Python, Max, and reality collide!!"
				}

